  "historyNote": "#7214, eff 6-1-00; amd by #8819, EXEMPT, eff 2-1-07; ss by #9286, EXEMPT, eff 9-29-08; ss by #10460, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12655, EXEMPT, eff 11-1-18; ss by #14161, EXEMPT, eff 12-27-24",
